  "releaseNotes": "App 1.3.0 / drivers 1.2.0: NEW APP LOCATION: YoLink Device Local Service now appears under Integrations in the Hubitat sidebar, not Apps (hub firmware 2.5.0+; older firmware still shows it under Apps). Your existing setup and devices are unchanged. device-token refresh fixed (polls no longer fail after a token change); access token refreshed before expiry and on HTTP 401; battery 0 shows 0% (was -1%); partial reports no longer reset contact/leak/motion/power state; MQTT Listener reset keeps working, re-subscribes and backs off on reconnect; THSensor temperature correction converted correctly; secrets no longer logged or stored in device state; fewer forced events; debug logging auto-off after 30 minutes. HPM names/namespace now match the code - run Match Up if HPM does not see the installed app/drivers. After updating, open the YoLink app and click Done once: this removes old credentials from device state and re-arms the debug auto-off.",
